      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really sorry to hear about your discomfort, but I must advise against rubbing your eye more as it can cause further irritation or damage. Immediately rinse your eye with cool, clean water to flush out any residue both from the degreaser and the chamomile eye drops. You’ll need to seek medical attention as soon as possible to avoid risking more severe damage to your eye - a trip to your doctor should be a priority now. It might also be helpful to try a clean, damp cloth to gently wipe away any surface debris. Stay calm, and let's make sure your eye receives the professional care it needs.",
